From 8ec6328bfdf2a456e86175624d7bbb0955657f94 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Braun <sam@webry.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:51:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: retire list_files, side_names, abort_merge; disk
 versions never repeat

The window lists with list_stop and aborts with abort_operation, so
the old commands, FileList, merging.rs and their ipc methods go.
A reopened stop numbers disk versions after the old session's highest,
so a stale write is refused in Rust too (#1383).

Refs plan #88 #89
